-- Regression case for a COMPTRAJ trajectory in degenerate position.
--
-- A vertical well at x = y = 1000 m on a 33 x 33 grid of 2000/33 m cells sits at
-- the exact centre of cell (17,17).  The path then runs along the diagonal that
-- splits each horizontal cell face into two triangles, the extractor emits
-- coincident enter/leave events, and before the general-position displacement in
-- WellConnections::loadCOMPTRAJ this produced ZERO connections -- silently.
-- The same well is fine on 11, 13, 15, 17, 21, 27 and 41 cells, so the case has
-- to pin the geometry exactly.
RUNSPEC
DIMENS
  33 33 5 /
OIL
WATER
METRIC
START
 1 'JAN' 2020 /
WELLDIMS
 5 10 10 5 /
UNIFIN
UNIFOUT
GRID
INIT
TOPS
  1089*1900 /
DXV
  33*60.60606061 /
DYV
  33*60.60606061 /
DZV
  5*20 /
EQUALS
  PERMX 100 6* /
  PERMY 100 6* /
  PERMZ 10  6* /
  PORO  0.25 6* /
/
PROPS
SOLUTION
SCHEDULE
WELSPECS
 'PROD' 'G1' 1* 1* 1* 'OIL' 2* 'SHUT' /
/
WELTRAJ
-- WELL BRANCH   X      Y      TVD     MD
 'PROD' 1*     1000   1000     0.0     0.0 /
 'PROD' 1*     1000   1000  2100.0  2100.0 /
/
COMPTRAJ
-- WELL BRANCH PERF_TOP PERF_BOT  ...  DIAM
 'PROD' 1*      1940.0   1980.0  1*  1*  1*  1*  1*  0.216  1* 1* 1* /
/
END
